---
title: OpenTelemetry Collector
---
The collector receives OTLP telemetry and prints it via the debug exporter.
Senders sharing its namespace reach it at `otel-collector:4317`; from another
namespace use the fully qualified
`otel-collector.<namespace>.svc.cluster.local:4317`.

Watch what it receives:

  kubectl logs -f deploy/otel-collector
